  "description": "Wild Times was a small, international furry convention in northern Germany, started to fill a lack of conventions in the region and hosted in English to convey a European setting. The first was held September 19 to 22, 2019, at the Kulturhaus in Osterholz-Scharmbeck with 56 attendees, themed \"Welcome to the Woods\". It was held annually through 2023, growing to 72 attendees, and no future conventions are planned.",
